92
00:04:58.423 --> 00:04:59.508
-Berikan padanya sudah.
-Astaga.

93
00:04:59.591 --> 00:05:00.634
-Maaf.
-Kebaikan.

94
00:05:00.717 --> 00:05:01.843
-Oh, sayang.
-[Meri] Terima kasih.

95
00:05:01.927 --> 00:05:03.345
-Saya betul-betul minta maaf.
-[Meri] Terima kasih.

96
00:05:03.428 --> 00:05:04.513
Maaf.

97
00:05:06.640 --> 00:05:09.518
Oh, sayang, dia kelihatan baik-baik saja,
tetapi dia pasti sakit.

98
